               cargo,
               rustc (>= 1.75),
               libgtk-4-dev (>= 4.14),
               libadwaita-1-dev (>= 1.5),
               libheif-dev,
               pkgconf,
               make,
               libglib2.0-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/ABHILESH1412/glance
